### How long does it typically take to transition to an AI/ML engineer role?

Most backend developers need 3-6 months of focused learning to become competitive for AI roles. This includes completing ML courses, building 3-4 production-ready projects, and mastering deployment tooling. Your timeline depends on how much time you dedicate daily and whether you have prior Python experience.

