## How much does the Google Professional Machine Learning Engineer certification cost?

The registration fee is $200, plus tax where applicable.

Google’s exam terms state that payment is required each time you take an exam, so a retake costs another $200. The terms also cap attempts: four in a two-year period, with a 14-day wait after the first failed attempt, 60 days after the second and 365 days after the third.

There is no shorter or cheaper renewal exam for this certification. Google’s renewal FAQ groups it with the professional certifications that renew through the standard exam, so keeping the credential means paying the full fee again every two years.

