# Dawn of segmented bilaterians unveiled by soft-bodied fossils in microbial pseudomorphs from the Basal Cambrian

 View ORCID Profile Xiaoguang Yang, Deng Wang, Farid Saleh, View ORCID Profile Zhiliang Zhang, Jie Sun, Wenjing Hao, Kentaro Uesugi, Tsuyoshi Komiya, View ORCID Profile Xing Wang, View ORCID Profile Jian Han
